wavering:
Far out in the night,
On the wavering sight
I see a dark hull loom;

wavelets:
The paddles plash,
The wavelets dash,
We see the summer lightning flash;

Across the summer sky;
The happy wavelets lash the shore,--
The tide is rising high.

